    "body": "This is likely caused by your prompt being too long. The `>` contraction of the prompt is the behavior of fish, and is out of our control.\n\nWe have an open issue to work on intelligent contraction of the prompt, but for the time being I'd suggest either reducing the number of modules used, or enlarging your terminal window.",
